{"4885500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CYBERSPIDER VS. HUMANITY", "steam_appid": 4885500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Future Belongs to Machines. The Future Belongs to Spiders.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The machines have calculated the inevitable: spiders will inherit the planet. To ensure their survival, they have created the ultimate  evolution of warfare — <strong>CYBERSPIDER</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>CYBERSPIDER</strong>. Humanity is in the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a massive cybernetic spider mech and tear through waves of soldiers, tanks, and military forces in a strategic action roguelike. Build your arsenal, choose powerful upgrades, and evolve your eight-legged engine of destruction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become the Ultimate Cybernetic Predator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from active abilities, passive weapons, and buffs to transform your <strong>CYBERSPIDER</strong>'s combat capabilities. Discover rare items, create specialized builds, and adapt your arsenal to overcome whatever humanity throws at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885500/extras/f70452d28a0cb2c3588f62b17353389c.avif?t=1785183905\" width=975 height=574 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Humanity Has Prepared for War. It Isn't Enough.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on increasingly dangerous waves of infantry, armored vehicles, and more military forces as humanity escalates its reponse. Adjust your strategy, overcome new threats, and the world will fear <strong>CYBERSPIDER</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885500/extras/85446c24c574b0a9888495b6da7b6d80.avif?t=1785183905\" width=1010 height=600